{"3431970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "My Slimadatchi", "steam_appid": 3431970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/399d1fd450406c96d50deecfd2e68d09.avif?t=1783345642\" width=1280 height=266 /></span>My Slimadatchi is a low-stress desktop virtual pet that lives on your desktop! Place your Slimadatchi device anywhere on your screen, play with your slime, or focus on your work or other games while your slime hops around, plays with toys, enjoys activities, or takes a nap in its own customizable device shell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care and Bond With Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your slime their favorite treats, give them head pats, and spend time together throughout the day! When they're not resting, they'll happily seek out toys to play with and activities to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Slime and Device Your Own!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the points your slime earns through playing and hanging out with you to buy treats, toys, clothes, and cosmetics to make their little world your own. Unlock up to 150+ new cosmetics for your slime, and the Slimadatchi shell itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy The Music Room!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your slime interact and vibe in the music room using the built-in music player! Play included songs, or import your own music and watch your slime vibe to your favorite tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coexisting with Your Slime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since slimes don’t share the same biology as us, they are immortal, independent, and happy just to be with you! This makes them the perfect multitasking companion. Place your Slimadatchi device anywhere you like, resize it to your preference, and your slime will always be there while you work, stream, play other games, or simply relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/399d1fd450406c96d50deecfd2e68d09.avif?t=1783345642\" width=1280 height=266 /></span>My Slimadatchi is a low-stress desktop virtual pet that lives on your desktop! Place your Slimadatchi device anywhere on your screen, play with your slime, or focus on your work or other games while your slime hops around, plays with toys, enjoys activities, or takes a nap in its own customizable device shell.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Care and Bond With Your Slime</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your slime their favorite treats, give them head pats, and spend time together throughout the day! When they're not resting, they'll happily seek out toys to play with and activities to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/05bea52d23bcdd17352a4b6d13a05ce5.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Your Slime and Device Your Own!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the points your slime earns through playing and hanging out with you to buy treats, toys, clothes, and cosmetics to make their little world your own. Unlock up to 150+ new cosmetics for your slime, and the Slimadatchi shell itself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/cd1be2d95c51b31995ac5c50a74c5ca6.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy The Music Room!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your slime interact and vibe in the music room using the built-in music player! Play included songs, or import your own music and watch your slime vibe to your favorite tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/fbbfe6405f0650435356fc34e0c0e931.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Coexisting with Your Slime!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since slimes don’t share the same biology as us, they are immortal, independent, and happy just to be with you! This makes them the perfect multitasking companion. Place your Slimadatchi device anywhere you like, resize it to your preference, and your slime will always be there while you work, stream, play other games, or simply relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.poster.avif?t=1783345642\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.webm?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/extras/66b9d030b4c365d06e04ad2296bc9880.mp4?t=1783345642\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A cozy desktop companion idle game where you care for your adorable slime as it plays, enjoys treats, listens to music, fishes, and more. Earn slime points to unlock new toys, customize your Slimadatchi shell, and dress up your slime to create a companion that's truly your own!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/5efe7370887c4ccc0ef3c018efa2bedce902a569/header.jpg?t=1783345642", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431970/f478a9d4360479e531443f99f14726a8604092ce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783345642", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431